{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"Megan has 5 pieces of candy. Since Mary has 3 times as much candy as Megan, she initially has 3 * 5 = 15 pieces of candy. After adding 10 more pieces, Mary has 15 + 10 = 25 pieces of candy in total.\nQuestion: If Megan has 5 pieces of candy, how many does Mary have in total?"}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"description":"Response value","type":"integer"}},"required":["answer"]}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}